# Claude Code (local config, commands, prompts)
.claude/
# Ignore local prompt scratch files, but keep the project's system prompts —
# proof-pilot / scribe-cli and the Docker image depend on lean-prover.md, and
# `scribe refute` on lean-refuter.md.
prompts/*
!prompts/lean-prover.md
!prompts/lean-refuter.md
!prompts/golf-prover.md

# zkGolf per-challenge state + attempt journals (scribe golf)
golf/
NOTES.md

# zkGolf corpus: vendored external repos + harvested submissions (regenerate
# with `git clone` per docs/clean-playbook.md and `scripts/harvest.sh`).
# Anchored to the specific vendored subdirs: /corpus/circuits and /corpus/msm
# are versioned first-class corpora (roadmap v2.1, locked decision 5), and a
# bare `corpus/` also swallowed lean/ZkGadgets/Corpus on case-insensitive
# filesystems.
/corpus/clean/
/corpus/submissions/
/corpus/zk-golf-challenges/

# MCP config (local dev)
.mcp.json

# Environment
.env
